  "releaseNotes": "## v2.1.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v2.0.0:\n\n- Seed the chart with every release that can be measured the same way [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Map the reports to parsed documents rather than reparsing in the body [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Write the benchmark history tool in C# rather than Python [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Chart performance per release, and show it in the README [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Gate Dependabot auto-merge on CI actually being green ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: do the formatting length arithmetic in long [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Write benchmark results where the workflow looks for them [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [patch] Fix conversion edge cases found in review ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- ci: adopt the consolidated .NET workflow [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
